"type":"paragraph","text":"A.継続は力なり です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のあたしにぴったりかな〜と\nうん☆まさにこれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/good.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ゆったんが見た最悪の夢は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.えーー夢"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/night.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は見るとき\n必ず怖いやつです(;o;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/rain.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間連続で 追いかけられる夢\nを見た時は本当にﾔﾊﾞｲと\n思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/thunder.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/thunder.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか、お母さんと弟が\nｿﾞﾝﾋﾞになった夢とか\nですかね?(´:ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜかお父さんは出て\n来なかったww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ｷﾑﾁ鍋ｽｷですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.はいはい♪あたし鍋料理で\n１番ｷﾑﾁ鍋が大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして締めはうどん派ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.短距離派?長距離派?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.実際どっちもまずまず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cloud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今年の体育大会では\n100mの選手として\n走ってましたww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってどこの運動会の回を\n見てくれた方は分かると\n思いますがあのﾀｲﾑでって?\n感じです (´Д｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bomb.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.体重は何ｷﾛですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.え、え、んーーー\n答えられれないよ(;o;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/thunder.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしはﾀﾞｲｴｯﾄを2日前から決意しました。頑張るん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/rock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.食べ物とか動物で\n苦手な物ある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んーー食べ物はﾌﾞﾛｯｺﾘｰ系。\n茎みたいなとこが どうしても\n動物はーー前まで孔雀は\n苦手でした。今は孔雀に\n会わないから分からないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img